6180       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
6180     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
6181       %let syscc=0;
6182       title; footnote;
6183       ods _all_ close;
6184       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
6185       ods graphics off;
6186       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.CONTRIVED (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASMAC1 (memtype=CATALOG).
