NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASMAC2 (memtype=CATALOG).
6186     !                                         quit;


6187       ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
6188       
6189       data Enzyme;
6190       input Concentration Velocity @@;
6191       datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.ENZYME has 14 observations and 2 variables.

6199       ;
6200       proc nlin data=Enzyme method=marquardt hougaard;
6201       parms theta1=155
6202       theta2=0 to 0.07 by 0.01;
6203       model Velocity = theta1*Concentration / (theta2 + Concentration);
6204       run;

NOTE: DER.theta1 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.theta2 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: Convergence criterion met.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE NLIN printed pages 402-403.

